    "title": "Thomas Balkcom, Former Savannah State Assistant Coach Dies - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Savannah Tribune ,\n1 days ago Thomas Balkcom, who spent two seasons as an assistant football coach at Savannah State has died. Balkcom, who was on the Tigers coaching staff under Steve Davenport, died unexpectedly on May 23, 2026 at age 58. During his time a SSU, he was the safeties coach and special teams coordinator.... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
